WEBVTT

00:03:59.466 --> 00:04:02.903
The gap between these rounds
of infection is about five days.

00:04:02.927 --> 00:04:05.188
So if you imagine
that you've got one case now,

00:04:05.212 --> 00:04:09.386
that's, kind of, six of these
five-day steps in a month.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.776
So by the end of that month,

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.958
that one person could have generated,

00:04:12.982 --> 00:04:15.712
I think it works out at about 729 cases.

00:04:15.736 --> 00:04:17.291
So even in a month,

00:04:17.315 --> 00:04:19.578
just the scale of this thing
can really shoot up

00:04:19.602 --> 00:04:21.135
if it's not controlled.

00:04:22.236 --> 00:04:23.400
CA: And so certainly,

00:04:23.424 --> 00:04:26.495
that seems to be happening
on most numbers that you look at now,

00:04:26.519 --> 00:04:29.399
certainly where the virus
is in the early stages

00:04:29.423 --> 00:04:31.447
of entering a country.